# Paths Octopus skips for review and indexing. Syntax: .gitignore.
# Octopus reads this file from the PR base commit.

# Archived OpenSpec changes, and the files `openspec update` generates.
# openspec/specs/ and active changes stay reviewable.
openspec/changes/archive/
.claude/commands/opsx/
.claude/skills/openspec-*/
.agents/skills/openspec-*/

# Built SvelteKit bundle, embedded by web/embed.go. The source is web/src/.
web/build/

# Protobuf codegen that the built-in list does not match (it matches *.pb.go)
*.connect.go
web/src/lib/gen/

# Lockfiles that `mise lock` writes
mise.lock
.mise/locks/

# Frozen corpus goldens that `task golden:regen` writes and `task
# test:golden` checks byte for byte. GitHub sends no patch for a large one.
testdata/golden/corpus/
